  "comments": [
    {
      "position": 0,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "<b>~kakeru</b> is for verbs:\n言いかけ　（いいかけ）\nIn the middle of saying something\n\n本を読みかけて、寝てしまいました\nI fell asleep with the book half read.\n\n<b>~kakeno</b> is a modifier for nouns (eg. tabekake no ringo)\n食べかけのりんご\nA half-eaten apple\n\n<b>~kake da</b> comes at the end of a sentence\nwhere だ is derived from です\n書きかけだ\nit is in the middle of being written",
      "html": "&lt;b&gt;~kakeru&lt;/b&gt; is for verbs:<br/>言いかけ　（いいかけ）<br/>In the middle of saying something<br/><br/>本を読みかけて、寝てしまいました<br/>I fell asleep with the book half read.<br/><br/>&lt;b&gt;~kakeno&lt;/b&gt; is a modifier for nouns (eg. tabekake no ringo)<br/>食べかけのりんご<br/>A half-eaten apple<br/><br/>&lt;b&gt;~kake da&lt;/b&gt; comes at the end of a sentence<br/>where だ is derived from です<br/>書きかけだ<br/>it is in the middle of being written",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "ce33c6bfbc458b919cdb61df4d3b860721c31a72e48247866ab62b800627d268",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 1,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "食べかけの is simply the noun form of 食べかける with の acting as a modifier. I think there is no difference in meaning between '食べかけたケーキ' and '食べかけのケーキ' (although the latter is much more common).",
      "html": "食べかけの is simply the noun form of 食べかける with の acting as a modifier. I think there is no difference in meaning between '食べかけたケーキ' and '食べかけのケーキ' (although the latter is much more common).",
      "credits_raw": "your name",
      "content_sha256": "3d305b438106dcea6c5e255df98c78759806adf21d3823dc9d2ffeea6194a219",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 2,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "as someone else pointed out the かけた in 話しかけた　is nothing to do with this grammar, it's a set phrase \n彼は私に話しかけた。\n\"he started to talk to me\"",
      "html": "as someone else pointed out the かけた in 話しかけた　is nothing to do with this grammar, it's a set phrase <br/>彼は私に話しかけた。<br/>\"he started to talk to me\"",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "53bc4b0f3daac2614a574e8436272209e34827567e2815db7fa4f8dfaf1464bb",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 3,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "this might fall into a category of verb endings, including -dashita",
      "html": "this might fall into a category of verb endings, including -dashita",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "820b1e8c6f6562f70de215b97734a0b54010cdd58e1a0b56ffd9421196f36e75",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 4,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I'm still not convinced of \"to almost start\" as distinct from \"to start (but not finish)\" although there are cases where both could be used in translations of sentences using かけた.",
      "html": "I'm still not convinced of \"to almost start\" as distinct from \"to start (but not finish)\" although there are cases where both could be used in translations of sentences using かけた.",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "ebcd15f81d5ce71e63bf5b73682e86d191597a86fb87c2e5a4edfb51f07320c8",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 5,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "書きかけた is incorrect, and should be 書きかけだ.",
      "html": "書きかけた is incorrect, and should be 書きかけだ.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "0f6396b2a7b8bf3bd28cf46dc4a89bf15680f3d48e50d5cf93ad066458b5a7ff",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 6,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "飲み かけた is incorrect and should be 飲みかけの",
      "html": "飲み かけた is incorrect and should be 飲みかけの",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "7ae6c7337c0e0f343828c307444a51a818b0624d03ccfb744c4dbb043d58df6d",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 7,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "読み かけた means \"just started to read\" and does not have the context of \"I didn't finish reading it\" which would be 読み終えなかった.",
      "html": "読み かけた means \"just started to read\" and does not have the context of \"I didn't finish reading it\" which would be 読み終えなかった.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "d842c989271e8cf208d05b132741aecc6e5ecf62073e9b6058bdc8602a187265",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 8,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "corrections made, thanks!",
      "html": "corrections made, thanks!",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "cb53629cb273192ae533c3e6e7b88584cc2c6263de6aca132fb95f185f727dc4",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 9,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "書きかけた does seem to be a valid (if low) usage - 3,000 Google hits compared to \n(書きかけ　-書きかけた)'s 27,600.\nDo 飲みかけ, 書きかけ etc belong in the same entry as 読みかけた ?",
      "html": "書きかけた does seem to be a valid (if low) usage - 3,000 Google hits compared to <br/>(書きかけ　-書きかけた)'s 27,600.<br/>Do 飲みかけ, 書きかけ etc belong in the same entry as 読みかけた ?",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "7ccab96f12d20f50430a6ac16e44ac69ddee5f7025f8503ee0b7d4791dc55d60",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 10,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I suppose 読みかけた doesn't have the nuance of 読み終えなかった - because that would imply that you probably aren't going to finish it.",
      "html": "I suppose 読みかけた doesn't have the nuance of 読み終えなかった - because that would imply that you probably aren't going to finish it.",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "4bfa6a2408878254e91e56473e57140c6ca386954bdcc4abd8c704fee0852284",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 11,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Presumably they are all based on \nかける (aux-v,v1) to turn on; to dial (e.g. phone); to start doing something (but not finish)",
      "html": "Presumably they are all based on <br/>かける (aux-v,v1) to turn on; to dial (e.g. phone); to start doing something (but not finish)",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "18572feed46853c6da81c85042cbeb1a142f59f02882d7aae5e58809527d5d21",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 12,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Maybe this entry should be changed to 'かける - To start (but not finish) something' with the noun + past tense verb form noted in comments.",
      "html": "Maybe this entry should be changed to 'かける - To start (but not finish) something' with the noun + past tense verb form noted in comments.",
      "credits_raw": "Amatuka",
      "content_sha256": "05261026caf18e29e6b6cd2b814f8544140ba046d76af2aac800a35702729982",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 13,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "Made the change by deleting 私は in #1612. Not need in the context.",
      "html": "Made the change by deleting 私は in #1612. Not need in the context.",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "cd431c47431dcb187da3b3681e85c9b1ed31acb27af82979f69cc6b2e2b49e7c",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 14,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "私はケーキを 食べ かけた should be 私が",
      "html": "私はケーキを 食べ かけた should be 私が",
      "credits_raw": "bamboo4",
      "content_sha256": "68ebbe22e93e322f43d7217354629d1b1b4127fc9433ff7868f87693ae0ceb44",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 15,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "The english in ex#1082 is really awkward. I think it should be \"Whose is this half-eaten bento box?\"",
      "html": "The english in ex#1082 is really awkward. I think it should be \"Whose is this half-eaten bento box?\"",
      "credits_raw": "CorDarei",
      "content_sha256": "87c66d0b6750782d2c7abd8fb1b297e587f09a8903f830abe386284fdd35968e",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 16,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "you're right, that is a literal translation...trying to keep the same order as the japanese. out of style i guess on this site, so i moved it to the notes section.",
      "html": "you're right, that is a literal translation...trying to keep the same order as the japanese. out of style i guess on this site, so i moved it to the notes section.",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "8e0916ff41d3a3521cd613847983640fa9eb7209fdc125fe1455e4c4929d9302",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 17,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "I think this has two meanings: \n1. to start (but not finish) \n2. to almost start",
      "html": "I think this has two meanings: <br/>1. to start (but not finish) <br/>2. to almost start",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "e822b9236de7cdcc34e083c657ceb978aeb2469e121a9acdf2ab095df74322db",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 18,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "not yet tho!",
      "html": "not yet tho!",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "db86d66436555ab01cd3919661b033bb251c1a167e627fb20586faabf06f7c22",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 19,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "also \n食べかけた（時に、、、）\nis different from \n食べかけの+noun",
      "html": "also <br/>食べかけた（時に、、、）<br/>is different from <br/>食べかけの+noun",
      "credits_raw": "dc",
      "content_sha256": "7b89d0952b7fe093358236b829cc887a01761b2ff3d34ccf61ddb7c692de0593",
      "original_created_at": null,
      "original_updated_at": null
    },
    {
      "position": 20,
      "source_id": null,
      "text": "what would you say this means kaketa arnou i have taken the spelling off something heard so it is probably incorect",
      "html": "what would you say this means kaketa arnou i have taken the spelling off something heard so it is probably incorect",
      "credits_raw": "rudy",
      "content_sha256": "b575c1e8412345195f2bf749105133d293584ce053b0e175feaa10218d36103d",
      "original_created_at": null,
